  "factor_name": "Cross-Asset Dispersion-Conditioned Volatility-Scaled Reversal 20D",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "cross_section_center( -(close[t-1]/close[t-11]-1) / (std(pct_change[t-20:t-1])*sqrt(20)) * (1 + 0.5*tanh(zscore_120(cross_sectional_std(pct_change[t-1])))) )",
    "description": "Ranks lagged 10-day reversal scaled by trailing 20-day volatility, with a common multiplier that increases modestly when recent cross-asset return dispersion is high. All inputs are lagged through the prior completed day; higher values indicate stronger reversal candidates."
